# CR 613.8a: a layer 7b effect depends on another when applying the other
# changes what it applies to. Andrios, Roaming Explorer (earlier timestamp)
# gives 16/9 to tapped creatures with base 4/3 while it attacks. Maha (later
# timestamp) sets the base toughness of Andrios's controller's creatures to 1.
# Andrios's set depends on Maha's, so Maha applies first, Andrios is a base
# 4/1, and its own effect no longer reaches it: it deals 4. Applied in
# timestamp order, Andrios would turn 16/9 first and then 16/1 (the later
# timestamp's toughness) and deal 16.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
